      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minonk%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Beyond trains, Minonk grew around lumber yards and coal mines, making it a bustling industrial hub in its early years.",
